  ; --- effects ------------------------------------------------------------------
  ; What a body performs, read off the tree. It follows the same forms the typer does,
  ; because what is an expression and what is a name or a pattern depends on the form: a
  ; field called `log` is not a call to anything. A call performs what the function it
  ; names declares, a primitive what the kernel's table says, and a few forms perform
  ; something of their own -- a log line `Log`, a channel `Ipc`, a scope `Clock`, a
  ; model whatever its device is.
